{"seq":1,"slug":"3d-positional-audio","title":"3D 定位音频：距离衰减、多普勒效应与声像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/spatial-audio/3d-positional-audio","wordCount":946,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"3d-定位音频-距离衰减-多普勒效应与声像\">3D 定位音频：距离衰减、多普勒效应与声像</h1><p>3D 定位音频将游戏世界中声源的位置信息转换为可感知的方向感和距离感。正确实现距离衰减、多普勒频移和声像声道映射，是构建沉浸式游戏音频体验的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>听者坐标系（Listener Space）</strong>：所有 3D 计算的参考框架，由听者的位置、朝向、向上向量定义，声源位置转换为相对坐标后处理。</li>\n<li><strong>距离衰减（Distance Falloff）</strong>：声音随距离衰减的数学模型，平方反比（物理正确）或自定义样条曲线（艺术控制）。</li>\n<li><strong>多普勒效应（Doppler Effect）</strong>：相对运动导致的频率变化，接近时升调、远离时降调；用 dopplerFactor 参数控制效果强度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"听者坐标系\">听者坐标系</h2><p>所有 3D 音频计算都在<strong>听者坐标系</strong>中进行。听者（Listener）通常绑定在摄像机或玩家头部，定义了「我的位置、我面朝的方向、我的头顶方向」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct AudioListener {&#10;    Vector3 position;   // 世界空间位置&#10;    Vector3 forward;    // 朝向（归一化）&#10;    Vector3 up;         // 向上（归一化）&#10;    Vector3 velocity;   // 速度（用于多普勒计算）&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 将世界空间声源位置转换为听者本地坐标&#10;Vector3 worldToListenerSpace(const Vector3&amp; sourceWorld,&#10;                              const AudioListener&amp; listener) {&#10;    Vector3 relative = sourceWorld - listener.position;&#10;    Vector3 right = listener.forward.cross(listener.up);&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        relative.dot(right),            // X: 右正左负&#10;        relative.dot(listener.up),      // Y: 上正下负&#10;        relative.dot(listener.forward)  // Z: 前正后负&#10;    };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 position;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 世界空间位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 forward;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 朝向（归一化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 up;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 向上（归一化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 velocity;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 速度（用于多普勒计算）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 将世界空间声源位置转换为听者本地坐标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worldToListenerSpace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> sourceWorld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                              const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioListener</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 relative </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceWorld </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listener.position;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listener.forward.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cross</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listener.up);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        relative.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(right),</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // X: 右正左负</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        relative.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listener.up),</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // Y: 上正下负</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        relative.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listener.forward)</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Z: 前正后负</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"距离衰减模型\">距离衰减模型</h2><p>声音在现实中以 <code>1/r²</code> 的规律衰减（球面扩散）。游戏中提供多种衰减模型以适应不同场景：</p>\n<h3 id=\"线性衰减\">线性衰减</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"gain = 1 - (distance - minDist) / (maxDist - minDist)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>gain = 1 - (distance - minDist) / (maxDist - minDist)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>计算简单，但不符合物理规律，适合 UI 音效或刻意营造卡通感的游戏：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>距离</th>\n<th>增益</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤ minDist</td>\n<td>1.0 (0 dB)</td>\n<td>全音量区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间距离</td>\n<td>线性插值</td>\n<td>均匀衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>≥ maxDist</td>\n<td>0.0 (-∞ dB)</td>\n<td>静音</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"平方反比衰减-物理正确\">平方反比衰减（物理正确）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"gain = minDist / max(distance, minDist)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>gain = minDist / max(distance, minDist)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>符合声学物理，距离翻倍衰减 6 dB，最接近真实听觉体验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"float inverseSquareFalloff(float distance, float minDist, float maxDist, float rolloffFactor) {&#10;    if (distance &lt;= minDist) return 1.0f;&#10;    if (distance &gt;= maxDist) return 0.0f;&#10;&#10;    float normalized = (distance - minDist) / (maxDist - minDist);&#10;    return 1.0f / (1.0f + rolloffFactor * normalized * normalized);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inverseSquareFalloff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> minDist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> maxDist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> rolloffFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minDist) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxDist) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minDist) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (maxDist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minDist);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rolloffFactor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalized);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义衰减曲线\">自定义衰减曲线</h3><p>Wwise 和 FMOD 都支持用<strong>样条曲线</strong>定义自定义衰减形状，音频设计师可以创建具有特定艺术效果的衰减（如远处若隐若现的鼓声）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[距离 0m] --&gt; |1.0 全音量| B[距离 20m]&#10;    B --&gt; |缓慢衰减| C[距离 50m]&#10;    C --&gt; |急速衰减| D[距离 100m]&#10;    D --&gt; |0.0 静音| E[距离 150m]\">graph LR\n    A[距离 0m] --&gt; |1.0 全音量| B[距离 20m]\n    B --&gt; |缓慢衰减| C[距离 50m]\n    C --&gt; |急速衰减| D[距离 100m]\n    D --&gt; |0.0 静音| E[距离 150m]</pre><h2 id=\"多普勒效应\">多普勒效应</h2><p>当声源或听者移动时，相对运动导致频率变化——接近时音调升高，远离时降低。</p>\n<p><strong>多普勒频率公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"f_observed = f_source × (c + v_listener) / (c + v_source)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>f_observed = f_source × (c + v_listener) / (c + v_source)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中 <code>c</code> 为声速（约 343 m/s）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"float calculateDopplerPitch(const Vector3&amp; sourcePos,&#10;                             const Vector3&amp; sourceVel,&#10;                             const Vector3&amp; listenerPos,&#10;                             const Vector3&amp; listenerVel,&#10;                             float speedOfSound = 343.0f,&#10;                             float dopplerFactor = 1.0f) {&#10;    Vector3 direction = (sourcePos - listenerPos).normalized();&#10;&#10;    // 沿视线方向的速度分量（正值表示远离）&#10;    float sourceSpeed   = sourceVel.dot(direction);&#10;    float listenerSpeed = listenerVel.dot(-direction);&#10;&#10;    float numerator   = speedOfSound + listenerSpeed;&#10;    float denominator = speedOfSound + sourceSpeed;&#10;&#10;    if (denominator &lt;= 0.0f) return 1.0f;  // 防止除零&#10;&#10;    float rawPitch = numerator / denominator;&#10;&#10;    // 用 dopplerFactor 控制效果强度（1.0 = 物理正确，0.5 = 柔和）&#10;    return std::lerp(1.0f, rawPitch, dopplerFactor);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDopplerPitch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> sourcePos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                             const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> sourceVel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                             const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listenerPos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                             const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listenerVel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                             float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> speedOfSound</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 343.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                             float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dopplerFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector3 direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sourcePos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listenerPos).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">normalized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 沿视线方向的速度分量（正值表示远离）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceSpeed   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceVel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(direction);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listenerSpeed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listenerVel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">direction);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numerator   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> speedOfSound </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listenerSpeed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denominator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> speedOfSound </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceSpeed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (denominator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 防止除零</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rawPitch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numerator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denominator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 用 dopplerFactor 控制效果强度（1.0 = 物理正确，0.5 = 柔和）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lerp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, rawPitch, dopplerFactor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多普勒参数建议</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>游戏类型</th>\n<th>推荐 dopplerFactor</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>赛车游戏</td>\n<td>1.0–1.2</td>\n<td>强调速度感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一人称射击</td>\n<td>0.5–0.8</td>\n<td>子弹呼啸效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角色扮演游戏</td>\n<td>0.0–0.3</td>\n<td>微妙，避免晕眩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚幻/科幻设定</td>\n<td>可超过 1.0</td>\n<td>艺术夸张</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声像-panning-算法\">声像（Panning）算法</h2><p>声像将 3D 空间位置映射到立体声或多声道输出的声道音量分配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"等功率声像-vbap-简化版\">等功率声像（VBAP 简化版）</h3><p>对于立体声输出，将听者本地 X 坐标映射到左右声道：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct StereoPan {&#10;    float left;&#10;    float right;&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 等功率声像（避免中央时两声道总功率升高）&#10;StereoPan equalPowerPan(float panValue) {  // panValue: -1.0(全左) to 1.0(全右)&#10;    const float PI_OVER_4 = 0.785398f;&#10;    float angle = panValue * PI_OVER_4;  // 映射到 [-π/4, π/4]&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        std::cos(angle + PI_OVER_4),  // 左声道&#10;        std::sin(angle + PI_OVER_4)   // 右声道&#10;    };&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 从 3D 位置计算声像&#10;StereoPan panFrom3DPosition(const Vector3&amp; listenerLocalPos) {&#10;    float horizontalAngle = std::atan2(listenerLocalPos.x, listenerLocalPos.z);&#10;    float normalizedPan = std::clamp(horizontalAngle / (float)M_PI, -1.0f, 1.0f);&#10;    return equalPowerPan(normalizedPan);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StereoPan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等功率声像（避免中央时两声道总功率升高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StereoPan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> equalPowerPan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> panValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // panValue: -1.0(全左) to 1.0(全右)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PI_OVER_4 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.785398</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> angle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> panValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PI_OVER_4;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 映射到 [-π/4, π/4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(angle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PI_OVER_4),</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 左声道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(angle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PI_OVER_4)</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 右声道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从 3D 位置计算声像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StereoPan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> panFrom3DPosition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> listenerLocalPos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> horizontalAngle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">atan2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(listenerLocalPos.x, listenerLocalPos.z);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalizedPan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(horizontalAngle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)M_PI, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> equalPowerPan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(normalizedPan);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"距离感的高频衰减\">距离感的高频衰减</h3><p>随着距离增大，高频成分比低频衰减更快（空气吸收效应）。用低通滤波器模拟此效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>距离</th>\n<th>低通截止频率</th>\n<th>感知效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0–10 m</td>\n<td>20000 Hz（不滤波）</td>\n<td>清晰、近处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–30 m</td>\n<td>8000–12000 Hz</td>\n<td>略显柔和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30–60 m</td>\n<td>4000–6000 Hz</td>\n<td>明显隔离感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60 m 以上</td>\n<td>2000–3000 Hz</td>\n<td>远处模糊感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 基于距离动态调整低通截止频率&#10;float distanceToLowpassCutoff(float distance) {&#10;    const float NEAR_DIST = 10.0f;&#10;    const float FAR_DIST  = 80.0f;&#10;    const float MAX_FREQ  = 20000.0f;&#10;    const float MIN_FREQ  = 2000.0f;&#10;&#10;    float t = std::clamp((distance - NEAR_DIST) / (FAR_DIST - NEAR_DIST), 0.0f, 1.0f);&#10;    return MAX_FREQ * std::pow(MIN_FREQ / MAX_FREQ, t);  // 对数插值&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于距离动态调整低通截止频率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distanceToLowpassCutoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NEAR_DIST </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FAR_DIST  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_FREQ  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20000.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MIN_FREQ  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2000.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NEAR_DIST) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (FAR_DIST </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NEAR_DIST), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_FREQ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(MIN_FREQ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_FREQ, t);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 对数插值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多声道游戏的声像矩阵\">多声道游戏的声像矩阵</h2><p>对于 5.1 或 7.1 输出，使用**向量分量声像（VBAP）**将 3D 方向分配到最近的两个扬声器：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    src[声源 方位角 45°] --&gt; |VBAP 计算| front[前置左 0.7]&#10;    src --&gt; |VBAP 计算| right[前置右 0.7]&#10;    src --&gt; |基本为0| center[中央 0.0]&#10;    src --&gt; |基本为0| rear[后置 0.0]\">graph TB\n    src[声源 方位角 45°] --&gt; |VBAP 计算| front[前置左 0.7]\n    src --&gt; |VBAP 计算| right[前置右 0.7]\n    src --&gt; |基本为0| center[中央 0.0]\n    src --&gt; |基本为0| rear[后置 0.0]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>3D 定位音频的核心是三个维度：距离衰减（平方反比最接近物理）、多普勒频移（用 dopplerFactor 控制艺术强度）和声像映射（等功率声像避免功率叠加）。高频随距离衰减是增强真实感的低成本手段。所有计算都依赖听者坐标系变换为前提。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"hrtf-and-binaural-rendering\">HRTF 与双耳渲染</a> — 超越声像：用头部传输函数实现真实的方位感</li>\n<li><a href=\"reverb-and-occlusion\">混响与遮挡</a> — 声音如何与环境几何体交互</li>\n<li><a href=\"./\">章节总览</a> — 空间音频系统三篇文档的学习路径与前置知识</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"3D 定位音频：距离衰减、多普勒效应与声像","id":"3d-定位音频-距离衰减-多普勒效应与声像"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"听者坐标系","id":"听者坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"距离衰减模型","id":"距离衰减模型"},{"level":3,"text":"线性衰减","id":"线性衰减"},{"level":3,"text":"平方反比衰减（物理正确）","id":"平方反比衰减-物理正确"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义衰减曲线","id":"自定义衰减曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"多普勒效应","id":"多普勒效应"},{"level":2,"text":"声像（Panning）算法","id":"声像-panning-算法"},{"level":3,"text":"等功率声像（VBAP 简化版）","id":"等功率声像-vbap-简化版"},{"level":3,"text":"距离感的高频衰减","id":"距离感的高频衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"多声道游戏的声像矩阵","id":"多声道游戏的声像矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"音频图与混音：Mixer Graph、Bus Hierarchy 与路由设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/audio-fundamentals/audio-graph-and-mixing"},"next":{"title":"HRTF 与双耳渲染：头部传输函数与耳机空间化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/spatial-audio/hrtf-and-binaural-rendering"}}